================================================================================
Pi (packages/coding-agent)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.2.0, revision 06a466935536f8c9bcacb2d5efc0fc021be1bdff.
Adapted in src/live/: the interactive frontend's prompt handling of
src/modes/interactive/interactive-mode.ts (onSubmit, which prompts while idle
and steers while streaming; onEscape and restoreQueuedMessagesToEditor, which
return queued prompts to the editor and abort; the initial and later
command-line messages run in order; handleEvent's mapping of agent and session
events to the transcript; and renderSessionContext's replay of a resumed
session), the built-in command names of src/core/slash-commands.ts, which
bake-rs refuses until they are ported, and, in src/live/commands.rs, the
/model, /thinking, and /settings commands of interactive-mode.ts
(handleModelCommand, its exact match from regression 7443,
showModelSelector, the thinking selector, and showSettingsSelector), and
the /session, /name, /new, and /resume commands of interactive-mode.ts
(handleSessionCommand, handleNameCommand, handleClearCommand,
showSessionSelector, and handleResumeSession) with the session switch of
src/core/agent-session-runtime.ts (newSession, switchSession). The case
"restores model and thinking state from the destination session" of
test/suite/agent-session-runtime.test.ts is adapted in
src/live/tests/sessions_live.rs. The /tree and /fork commands adapt
showTreeSelector (without its branch-summary prompt) and
showUserMessageSelector of interactive-mode.ts, and src/live/tree.rs adapts
src/modes/interactive/components/tree-selector.ts (TreeList's flattenTree,
default filter, recalculateVisualStructure, findNearestVisibleIndex, row
prefix, getEntryDisplayText, and formatToolCall) and
components/user-message-selector.ts, with cases of test/tree-selector.test.ts
and test/agent-session-branching.test.ts in src/live/tests/tree_rows.rs and
src/live/tests/sessions_live.rs.
/resume's search wires the session-selector search of
src/modes/interactive/components/session-selector.ts and
session-selector-search.ts into src/live/commands.rs (ResumeSearch).
/compact follows v1.2.0 src/modes/interactive/interactive-mode.ts (the
/compact parsing, handleCompactCommand, and the compaction_end rendering of
the kept entries with the summary below them), in src/live/commands.rs,
src/live/mod.rs, and src/live/projection.rs (replay_compacted), with the case
of test/interactive-mode-compaction.test.ts that renders retained entries in
src/live/tests/compact_live.rs.
